[*]Optional ISL patch script: [b]Hackfield[/b] - [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/45514]Immersive Spell Learning - DESTified[/url], its base script; [b]Ameisenfutter[/b] - the original Immersive Spell Learning; [b]Parapets[/b] - Don't Eat Spell Tomes; [b]GiraPomba[/b] - [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/121282]I Just Want to Sit Down and Read[/url], the sit-down study animations. Its Gate to Sovngarde CE Bookworm trait support is compatibility code only; no GTS CE files are included.
[*]Fonts: SIL Open Font License 1.1 (Google Fonts, LXGW Xiaolai) and Hakgyoansim Bunpil (KERIS)
[*]Panel icons (19): shapes from [url=https://game-icons.net]game-icons.net[/url] by [b]Delapouite[/b] and [b]Lorc[/b], licensed [url=https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/]CC BY 3.0[/url], redrawn as ink and chalk drawings for Heart of Magic (Arcane, Night Grimoire, Chalkboard); the Classic and Modern designs use recoloured line versions of the original shapes
[*]Showcase video: music - Paul Dukas, [i]L'apprenti sorcier[/i] (1897), Minneapolis Symphony Orchestra conducted by Dimitri Mitropoulos (Columbia, 1941; transfer by Bob Varney, [url=https://archive.org/details/SorcerersApprentice]Internet Archive[/url], CC0), restored and edited; voices - Skyrim's own NPC lines; fonts - Cinzel, EB Garamond, Hahmlet (SIL OFL)
[/list]

[b]License[/b]: Heart of Magic Librarian's own source files are MIT. The plugin DLLs statically link CommonLibSSE-NG (GPL-3.0-or-later with the Modding Exception and the GPL-3.0 Linking Exception), so the DLLs are a GPL-3.0-or-later combined work; [i]THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md[/i] and the [i]licenses[/i] folder in the download have the details, the other libraries' licenses and where the complete source is. Some parts come from others and keep their own licenses (listed in [i]THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md[/i]): the tome hook based on Don't Eat Spell Tomes (MIT), math code from fdlibm / V8, Risa's All In One Menu's integration header (MIT), the fonts (SIL OFL), the panel icon shapes from game-icons.net (CC BY 3.0), and the optional ISL patch script, which belongs to its original authors (Hackfield, with Sit Down and Read code by GiraPomba), is not under this project's MIT license and is released as a modified patch as their Nexus permissions allow, with credit. As the GPL requires, the permissions on this page allow modifying and redistributing the DLLs under those terms.
